<title>USA: Geerlings sees Q4 profit, year loss.</title>
<headline>Geerlings sees Q4 profit, year loss.</headline>
<dateline>CANTON, Mass. 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Geerlings &amp; Wade Inc said Tuesday it expects net income of about $0.01 per share for the fourth quarter on revenues of $9.3-$9.4 million.</p>
<p>The company said it expects to report a net loss of $0.06 per share for the year.</p>
<p>Geerlings reported a net loss of $0.18 per share in 1995.</p>
<p>It said 1996 revenues are expected to be $31.3-$31.4 million, up about six percent from 1995.</p>
<p>Geerlings &amp; Wade is a direct marketer of premium wines and wine-related products.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
